{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-target='computer\/programming\/visual_cpp' data-title='Visual C++'>\r\n\t\t\tVisual C++\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Accelerator Keys: if(!TranslateAccelerator(MainWindow.hWnd, hAccel, &msg)), include \"Resource.h\"., include \"AFXRes.h\"., BEGIN, # define ID_ACTION, and case WM_COMMAND.","label":"Accelerator Keys","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/clipboard","label":"ClipBoard","url":"\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/clipboard"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdvantage.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMessage always sent to the TranslateAcclerator:hWnd irrespective of focus.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThus no duplication required across window procs.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWinMain.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHACCEL hAccel = LoadAccelerators(hInstance, L\"WCODE\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWhile(GetMessage(&amp;msg, NULL, 0, 0) &gt; 0).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>{<\/h2>\n\t<h4>if(!TranslateAccelerator(MainWindow.hWnd, hAccel, &amp;msg))<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf(!IsDialogMessage(MainWindow.hWnd, &amp;msg)).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>{<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTranslateMessage(&amp;msg);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDispatchMessage(&amp;msg);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t};.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAccelerators.rc.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h3>include \"Resource.h\".<\/h3>\n\t<h3>include \"AFXRes.h\".<\/h3>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWCODE ACCELERATORS DISCARDABLE.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>BEGIN<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVK_TAB, MODE_BUTTON_ID, CONTROL, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVK_TAB, START_FOCUS_ID, SHIFT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"c\", IN_CLEAR_BUTTON_ID, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"S\", TOGGLE_SUG_ID, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVK_SPACE, OVER_SPACE, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVK_RETURN, CONVERT_BUTTON_ID, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"e\", IN_FOCUS, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"x\", CSM_CHECK_WINDOW_ID, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\"z\", MODE_BUTTON_ID, ALT, VIRTKEY.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEND.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tResource.h.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2># define ID_ACTION<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t0x0100.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tMainWindow - Proc.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>case WM_COMMAND<\/h2>\n\t<h4>{<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSwitch(LOWORD(wParam)).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>case ID_ACTION<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/accelerator_keys\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/visual_cpp\/accelerator_keys\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled s